IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. PEN0016.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 WS-IN-REC.
    COPY PEN0016C REPLACING ==:PFX:== BY ==CU==.
01 OUT-RECORD.
    05 LATE-FEE           PIC 9(5)V99 VALUE ZERO.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAINLINE.
    ACCEPT WS-IN-REC
    PERFORM CALC-LATE-FEE
    DISPLAY "LATE-FEE=" LATE-FEE
    STOP RUN.
CALC-LATE-FEE.
    EVALUATE TRUE
        WHEN CU-DPD-DAYS >= 1 AND CU-DPD-DAYS <= 10
            MOVE 25 TO LATE-FEE
        WHEN CU-DPD-DAYS >= 11 AND CU-DPD-DAYS <= 30
            MOVE 50 TO LATE-FEE
        WHEN CU-DPD-DAYS >= 31 AND CU-DPD-DAYS <= 999
            COMPUTE LATE-FEE = CU-BALANCE-DUE * 0.05
        WHEN OTHER
            MOVE 0 TO LATE-FEE
    END-EVALUATE.
